telgeuse.","s":176.2,"e":177.98,"line":61},{"w":"Guys…","s":179.34,"e":180.38,"line":62},{"w":"Seriously…","s":180.38,"e":181.42,"line":63},{"w":"Why","s":182.16,"e":183.04,"line":64},{"w":"is","s":183.04,"e":183.48,"line":64},{"w":"Sirius","s":183.48,"e":183.96,"line":64},{"w":"doing","s":183.96,"e":184.38,"line":64},{"w":"that?","s":184.38,"e":184.8,"line":64},{"w":"I","s":185.34,"e":185.76,"line":65},{"w":"did","s":185.76,"e":185.96,"line":65},{"w":"not","s":185.96,"e":186.2,"line":65},{"w":"approve","s":186.2,"e":186.66,"line":65},{"w":"Sirius.","s":186.66,"e":187.62,"line":65},{"w":"I","s":190.04,"e":191.08,"line":66},{"w":"just","s":191.08,"e":191.78,"line":66},{"w":"wanted","s":191.78,"e":192.66,"line":66},{"w":"Betelgeuse.","s":192.66,"e":193.74,"line":66}],"lines":[{"s":0,"e":0.4,"text":"Look—"},{"s":0.94,"e":3.12,"text":"I don’t know what happened to the rest of the sky."},{"s":3.46,"e":5.3,"text":"I had one target."},{"s":5.8,"e":7.08,"text":"One red giant."},{"s":7.54,"e":10.4,"text":"One cosmic résumé bullet."},{"s":13.96,"e":15.36,"text":"Betelgeuse blinking like it owes me rent,"},{"s":15.56,"e":17.02,"text":"Big red star with a dramatic event,"},{"s":17.06,"e":18.86,"text":"I said, “That one’s mine when the heavens bruise,”"},{"s":19,"e":20.62,"text":"I just wanted credit for Betelgeuse."},{"s":20.7,"e":22.4,"text":"Told my friends, “Watch Orion’s shoulder,”"},{"s":22.4,"e":23.96,"text":"When it goes boom, my legend gets older,"},{"s":24.1,"e":25.62,"text":"I don’t need proof, I don’t need clues,"},{"s":25.62,"e":27.98,"text":"I just need headlines saying, “He called Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":27.98,"e":29.58,"text":"Then the sky went pop, pop, pop,"},{"s":29.56,"e":31.32,"text":"Like the universe forgot to stop,"},{"s":31.46,"e":33.46,"text":"Everybody looked at me confused,"},{"s":33.8,"e":36.98,"text":"I said, “Guys… I only ordered Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":37.06,"e":38.62,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse,"},{"s":38.68,"e":41.6,"text":"One star flash, one cosmic excuse,"},{"s":41.66,"e":44.96,"text":"Why’d the whole damn galaxy light the fuse?"},{"s":44.96,"e":50.78,"text":"I have no idea, I just wanted Betelgeuse."},{"s":50.78,"e":53.4,"text":"Yeah, I’ll take credit, sure, why not?"},{"s":53.74,"e":56.9,"text":"One red giant was the whole damn plot,"},{"s":57.5,"e":60.96,"text":"But when all the other stars blew loose,"},{"s":61.1,"e":65.18,"text":"I said, “That’s not me—I just wanted Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":65.22,"e":66.94,"text":"News crews came with the satellite vans,"},{"s":67.08,"e":68.46,"text":"“Sir, did you trigger the stellar collapse?”"},{"s":68.52,"e":70.3,"text":"I said, “No comment, but print my shoes,"},{"s":70.22,"e":72.5,"text":"And spell my name right under Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":72.56,"e":74.28,"text":"People believed me, which felt kinda bad,"},{"s":74.28,"e":75.86,"text":"I was half a prophet, half fully mad,"},{"s":75.88,"e":77.7,"text":"I pointed upward like, “That’s my muse,”"},{"s":77.92,"e":80.96,"text":"Then twelve constellations started filing lawsuits."},{"s":81.14,"e":82.8,"text":"Then the sky went bang, bang, bang,"},{"s":82.8,"e":84.5,"text":"Every zodiac sign joined the gang,"},{"s":84.48,"e":86.66,"text":"Pisces crying, Leo accused,"},{"s":87.14,"e":90.36,"text":"I said, “Please calm down—I just wanted Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":90.36,"e":91.76,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse,"},{"s":91.84,"e":94.76,"text":"One star flash, one cosmic excuse,"},{"s":94.86,"e":98.26,"text":"Why’d the whole damn galaxy light the fuse?"},{"s":98.28,"e":103.86,"text":"I have no idea, I just wanted Betelgeuse."},{"s":104.02,"e":106.72,"text":"Yeah, I’ll take credit, sure, why not?"},{"s":106.88,"e":110.12,"text":"One red giant was the whole damn plot,"},{"s":110.4,"e":113.7,"text":"But when all the other stars blew loose,"},{"s":114.26,"e":118.32,"text":"I said, “That’s not me—I just wanted Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":118.4,"e":121.62,"text":"Maybe I whispered too loud at night,"},{"s":121.84,"e":125,"text":"Maybe the cosmos took it as a fight,"},{"s":125.3,"e":128.2,"text":"Maybe Orion had unpaid dues,"},{"s":128.34,"e":132.14,"text":"Maybe heaven heard “all stars” when I said “Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":132.18,"e":135.54,"text":"I didn’t ask for Andromeda smoke,"},{"s":135.62,"e":138.48,"text":"I didn’t ask for the Milky Way choke,"},{"s":138.48,"e":142.1,"text":"I had one wish, one flaming excuse,"},{"s":142.2,"e":145.8,"text":"A tasteful explosion from Betelgeuse."},{"s":147.43,"e":150.04,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse,"},{"s":150.12,"e":153.04,"text":"One red boom for the evening news,"},{"s":153.1,"e":156.34,"text":"Now the universe is spilling juice,"},{"s":156.34,"e":159.74,"text":"And somehow I’m the guy who lit the fuse."},{"s":159.98,"e":163.18,"text":"I’ll take the crown, but hear my truth:"},{"s":163.18,"e":166.6,"text":"This got bigger than my little spoof,"},{"s":166.6,"e":170.3,"text":"If every star now starts to lose,"},{"s":170.44,"e":173.66,"text":"Don’t blame me, man—"},{"s":174.6,"e":177.98,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse."},{"s":179.34,"e":180.38,"text":"Guys…"},{"s":180.38,"e":181.42,"text":"Seriously…"},{"s":182.16,"e":184.8,"text":"Why is Sirius doing that?"},{"s":185.34,"e":187.62,"text":"I did not approve Sirius."},{"s":190.04,"e":193.74,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse."}],"duration":196.32,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-29T02:49:44.388Z","stats":{"whisperWords":462,"polishedWords":443,"matched":412,"matchRate":0.93}}